; =====================================================
; FILE: sn-soldiers
; PURPOSE:
;   Controls soldier strategic numbers, scouting, stance, and combat micro settings.
;
; =====================================================
; *** Table of Contents *** 
; =====================================================
;
;	Chapter 0: SETUP
;	Chapter 1: SCOUTING
;	Chapter 2: STANCE
